# everywhere else. Declared here so Semgrep Cloud honors it too; the local
# CLI --exclude-rule flag is no longer needed.
# nosemgrep: java.lang.security.audit.xss.jsf.autoescape-disabled.autoescape-disabled
internal/server/static/*.html
